%% Transcript window statechart (saved session unless noted)
%% Omitted events: Crash, Resumed, BlockOpened/BlockChanged/BlockFinished within
%% the same retention state, CtrlOOpened/CtrlOClosed/CtrlOScrolledNewer, LogReadDone/
%% LogReadFailed (stale/duplicate/lost replies), ReprintTick slices, and --no-save
%% (where mid-turn compaction keeps the pre-compaction turn until turn end).

stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle: session starts

    Idle --> TurnRunning: user sends a prompt
    Idle --> WaitingTurnEnd: /compact between turns (L22 holds previous cycle)
    Idle --> ReadingFull: open Ctrl+O from memory (L10)

    WaitingTurnEnd --> TurnRunning: user sends next prompt
    WaitingTurnEnd --> BrokenL22: [bug] drop at /compact before next turn ends

    TurnRunning --> WaitingForSave: context compacts mid-turn
    TurnRunning --> Idle: turn ends and log confirms save

    WaitingForSave --> CompactedInTurn: log confirms pre-compaction pieces saved
    WaitingForSave --> WaitingForSave: mid-turn save fails (L3 holds blocks)
    WaitingForSave --> Idle: turn ends after save confirms
    WaitingForSave --> BrokenL3: [bug] drop mid-turn before log saved
    WaitingForSave --> BrokenL23: [today/bug] hold pre-compaction blocks even after save confirms

    CompactedInTurn --> CompactedInTurn: live tool updates or another mid-turn compaction + save
    CompactedInTurn --> Reprinting: terminal resized (reprints from last compaction with "Earlier in this turn: Ctrl+O")
    CompactedInTurn --> ReadingFull: open Ctrl+O (reads dropped prefix from log)
    CompactedInTurn --> Idle: turn ends
    CompactedInTurn --> BrokenL2L18: [bug] drop covers live or post-compaction blocks

    Reprinting --> CompactedInTurn: reprint slices finish (L15)
    ReadingFull --> CompactedInTurn: close Ctrl+O

    state "Rule broken (L23): HeldSinceLastCompaction\nShortest path: Idle -> send prompt -> compact mid-turn -> log saves" as BrokenL23
    state "Rule broken (L3): DropOnlySaved\nShortest path: Idle -> send prompt -> compact mid-turn -> save fails -> bug drops" as BrokenL3
    state "Rule broken (L2, L18): LiveNeverDropped / DropBetweenTurns\nShortest path: Idle -> send prompt -> compact mid-turn -> finish block -> bug drops past compaction" as BrokenL2L18
    state "Rule broken (L22): PreviousWaitsForTurnEnd\nShortest path: Idle -> /compact between turns -> bug drops at once" as BrokenL22
